---
import { RiArrowRightLine } from "@remixicon/react";
---

<section class="w-full px-5 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1120px] flex-col items-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-strong-950 px-6 py-16 text-center lg:px-12 lg:py-20">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 size-72 rounded-full bg-brand-500/25 blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 size-72 rounded-full bg-brand-400/15 blur-[100px]"></div>

    <h2 class="relative max-w-2xl text-title-h3 text-white lg:text-title-h2">
      Deja que la IA haga el trabajo repetitivo — tú enfócate en vender
    </h2>
    <p class="relative mt-4 max-w-xl text-paragraph-md text-white/60 lg:text-paragraph-lg">
      Empieza gratis hoy y descubre cuánto tiempo recuperas con AmunPOS trabajando por ti.
    </p>
    <div class="relative mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href="#Planes"
        class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-10 bg-primary-base px-5 text-label-md text-static-white transition duration-200 hover:bg-primary-darker"
      >
        Prueba gratuita
        <RiArrowRightLine className="size-4" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="#Planes"
        class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-10 border border-white/20 bg-transparent px-5 text-label-md text-white transition duration-200 hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        Ver planes
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
